# - Record lines 222-223: full density is overclaimed. The instrument lens recomputed only the class figures (counts, shares past white, pre-clamp medians, saturation after white balance, box means). The mechanism figures (first-fall tap, 0.52-0.58 factors, gain-table and blue-alone reproduction, gray-world) are on the 288 / 5,966 / 1,278 pixel sample. Some full-density figures moved: NIR_1376 past white at 0 is 0.3% sampled against 0.8% full; NIR_3700 is 4.5 to 2.5 sampled against 5.4 to 3.2. What held exactly is the sample reproducing the check files.
# - Record line 224: miscount. Twelve definitions were tested in total, the check's own among them, so eleven others.
